    "body": "## 1. How to delete your account\n\nUsers can request deletion from the CRW+ account settings in a short confirmation flow. CRW+ may send an email confirmation as part of the deletion process. Users can also request deletion at https://crw-plus.com/delete-account.\n\n## 2. What is deleted\n\nDeletion is intended to remove the CRW+ account and data associated with it, including profile information, workout history stored by CRW+, published posts, created clubs, created events, and other account-linked content. If the account created a club or event, that club or event is removed rather than transferred to another owner.\n\n## 3. Local-only data\n\nData stored only on your device may remain on that device until you remove it, clear app storage, or uninstall the app, depending on the operating system and feature behavior.\n\n## 4. Backup period\n\nResidual copies may remain in technical backups for up to 7 days before permanent removal. CRW+ may retain narrowly limited records for longer only where required by law or strictly necessary for security, fraud prevention, legal claims, or compliance.\n\n## 5. Deletion and third-party platforms\n\nDeleting CRW+ data does not automatically delete data stored independently by Apple Health, Health Connect, Google, your mobile carrier, or other third parties. You may need to manage those records through the relevant service or device settings.\n\n## 6. Contact\n\nIf the deletion flow does not work, contact support@crw-plus.com."
